1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Good morning, everyone.

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:06,200
The train to the coast
leaves from platform four.

3
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:08,000
<i>Is it on time</i> today?

4
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:10,900
{\an8}Platform 4: <font color="#ffd700">Coast Express</font>

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,400
Yes. <b>Seven minutes</b> to departure.

6
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:16,000
{\an8}<b>The train leaves at noon</b>

7
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,000
<u>Thank you</u>, and <s>good night</s> good day.
